                          </h1>

                          <div class="show-details__venue">
                <div class="show-details__venue-icon icon">
                            <div class="farlo-ui-icons__icon-container farlo-ui-icons__icon-container--location" style="--size:3;--fill:var(--global-primary-text-colour)">
