              </div>
                      </div>

                    
          <div class="show-details__text" data-collapsed="false">
            
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Can you feel the revolt? It’s coming.</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A chair, a candidate, a thousand eyes.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Brian Tran is being interviewed. Succeed, and he could become the most powerful leader in the world. But, as the interview tests become increasingly brutal, Brian is forced to face what might happen if he fails.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Black Mirror meets Succession in this tale of twisted family loyalty, cabalistic elites, and what we’re prepared to sacrifice for proximity to power.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">An exhilarating, unflinching thriller from Tony Craze award-winning writer <strong>Chris Fung</strong> (The Society For New Cuisine) and director <strong>Rupert Hands</strong> (End Of The Rainbow). </p>
          </div>
          <button class="show-details__text-read-more" aria-label="Read More about Global Majority">Read more</button>
        </div>
