                <div class="notification-content">
          <span class='h4'>Please Note:</span>
          <ul>
<li><strong>Content warnings: </strong>This production contains continued depiction of psychological abuse, torture &amp; harassment, depictions of &amp; allusions to physical violence &amp; injury, depiction of fingernail removal with pliers, depiction of the injection of a dangerous substance into an animal, depictions of self harm, references to abduction &amp; unlawful imprisonment, discussion of addiction and drug abuse, depiction of an overdose leading to death, use of weapons onstage including baseball bat, pliers &amp; a shock collar, extended discussion &amp; depiction of racism, themes of grief, death of a parent &amp; death of animals, strong language throughout &amp; infrequent use of anti-Asian slurs. This production may also contain Loud noises flashing lights, moments of darkness &amp; haze effects.</li>
<li>A self care guide can be found <a href="https://www.bushtheatre.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Global-Majority-self-care-guide.pdf"><strong>here</strong></a>.</li>
</ul>
