        <div class="site-accordion" id="faq-faqs-dynamic-0">
    <header class="site-accordion__heading">
        <button class="site-accordion__toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-0">
            <h4 class="h3">Where is Global Majority playing in London?</h4>
            <span class="site-accordion__icon"></span>
        </button>
    </header>

    <div id="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-0" class="site-accordion__content" role="region">
        <div class="site-accordion__content-inner">
            Global Majority is playing at Bush Theatre in London. Your ticket selection will show available performance dates and times, and you can book securely online via Official London Theatre. For the smoothest experience, pick a performance from the calendar and book early for popular dates.        </div>
    </div>
</div><div class="site-accordion" id="faq-faqs-dynamic-1">
    <header class="site-accordion__heading">
        <button class="site-accordion__toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-1">
            <h4 class="h3">What is Global Majority about?</h4>
            <span class="site-accordion__icon"></span>
        </button>
    </header>

    <div id="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-1" class="site-accordion__content" role="region">
        <div class="site-accordion__content-inner">
            Black Mirror meets Succession in this tale of twisted family loyalty, cabalistic elites, and what we’re prepared to sacrifice for proximity to power.        </div>
    </div>
</div><div class="site-accordion" id="faq-faqs-dynamic-2">
    <header class="site-accordion__heading">
        <button class="site-accordion__toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-2">
            <h4 class="h3">How long is Global Majority?</h4>
            <span class="site-accordion__icon"></span>
        </button>
    </header>

    <div id="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-2" class="site-accordion__content" role="region">
        <div class="site-accordion__content-inner">
            The running time for Global Majority is To be confirmed. Duration can occasionally vary slightly by performance, but this is the listed length for the production.        </div>
    </div>
</div><div class="site-accordion" id="faq-faqs-dynamic-3">
    <header class="site-accordion__heading">
        <button class="site-accordion__toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-3">
            <h4 class="h3">What age is Global Majority suitable for?</h4>
            <span class="site-accordion__icon"></span>
        </button>
    </header>

    <div id="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-3" class="site-accordion__content" role="region">
        <div class="site-accordion__content-inner">
            Global Majority is recommended for ages 16+. If you’re bringing younger theatregoers, it’s worth considering themes and attention span alongside the age guidance. Some venues also have their own admission policies, so it can help to double-check requirements before you travel.        </div>
    </div>
</div><div class="site-accordion" id="faq-faqs-dynamic-6">
    <header class="site-accordion__heading">
        <button class="site-accordion__toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-6">
            <h4 class="h3">Where can I buy tickets for Global Majority?</h4>
            <span class="site-accordion__icon"></span>
        </button>
    </header>

    <div id="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-6" class="site-accordion__content" role="region">
        <div class="site-accordion__content-inner">
            You can buy tickets for Global Majority online through Official London Theatre. Choose your preferred performance in the calendar, select seats if available, and complete your purchase securely.        </div>
    </div>
</div><div class="site-accordion" id="faq-faqs-dynamic-9">
    <header class="site-accordion__heading">
        <button class="site-accordion__toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-9">
            <h4 class="h3">What should I wear to see Global Majority?</h4>
            <span class="site-accordion__icon"></span>
        </button>
    </header>

    <div id="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-9" class="site-accordion__content" role="region">
        <div class="site-accordion__content-inner">
            There isn’t a strict dress code for London theatre, so wear whatever you’ll feel comfortable and confident in. Most people go for smart casual - think jeans or trousers with a nice top, a casual dress, or a shirt and trainers. If you’re heading to an evening show, on a date, or celebrating something, you might fancy dressing up a bit more, but it’s completely optional.        </div>
    </div>
</div><div class="site-accordion" id="faq-faqs-dynamic-10">
    <header class="site-accordion__heading">
        <button class="site-accordion__toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-10">
            <h4 class="h3">What time should I arrive for Global Majority?</h4>
            <span class="site-accordion__icon"></span>
        </button>
    </header>

    <div id="accordion-faq-faqs-dynamic-10" class="site-accordion__content" role="region">
        <div class="site-accordion__content-inner">
            Arriving at least 30 minutes before the scheduled start time helps keep things smooth and stress-free, giving you plenty of time to collect tickets, go through security, and get settled in your seat before the performance begins.        </div>
    </div>
</div>    </div>
